00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:15.640
that we're getting all
those kind of news stories

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:17.580
that I mentioned on
the previous slide.

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.720
After we pass through
the peak of expectations,

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.262
we tend to fall into
something called

00:02:21.262 --> 00:02:24.330
the trough of disillusionment,
after which enlightenment will

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.010
come and then productivity.

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:29.160
So as an example of this,
remember back in 2007 when

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.350
Steve Jobs came
