00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.928
it has limited battery life.

00:03:08.928 --> 00:03:10.470
There were various
things that I have

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:12.030
to still be able
to do on a desktop

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:13.950
