00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:01.133
Now, I'm curious, sometimes at
Next, we have a lot of coders,

00:04:01.133 --> 00:04:03.300
sometimes we have a lot of
people who aren't coders.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:04.380
Out of curiosity,
how many of you

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.380
are actual coders here,
